### Create Webhook
```http
POST /api/webhooks
```

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "New Lead Webhook",
  "description": "Webhook for new lead creation",
  "webhookType": "go",
  "brand": "TaxSales",
  "source": "Website",
  "fieldMapping": {
    "phone": "phone",
    "name": "full_name",
    "email": "email_address"
  },
  "validationRules": {
    "requirePhone": true,
    "requireName": true,
    "requireEmail": false,
    "allowDuplicatePhone": false
  },
  "autoTagRules": [
    {
      "field": "source",
      "operator": "equals",
      "value": "website",
      "tag": "website-lead"
    }
  ],
  "autoEnrollJourneyId": 1,
  "isActive": true
