```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": 2,
  "name": "New Lead Webhook",
  "endpointKey": "generated-key-here",
  "webhookUrl": "https://api.knittt.com/api/webhook-receiver/generated-key-here",
  "webhookType": "go",
  "securityToken": "generated-security-token",
  "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
}
```

### Update Webhook
```http
PUT /api/webhooks/{id}
```

**Request Body:** Same structure as create, all fields optional.

### Delete Webhook
```http
DELETE /api/webhooks/{id}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "Webhook deleted successfully",
  "id": 1
}
```

