## Error Codes

| Status | Code | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| 400 | Bad Request | Invalid request data or parameters |
| 401 | Unauthorized | Missing or invalid authentication token |
| 403 | Forbidden | Insufficient permissions |
| 404 | Not Found | Webhook or resource not found |
| 409 | Conflict | Duplicate webhook or constraint violation |
| 429 | Too Many Requests | Rate limit exceeded |
| 500 | Internal Server Error | Server processing error |

## Rate Limits

- Authenticated endpoints: 1000 requests per hour per user
- Public webhook receiver: 10,000 requests per hour per endpoint
- Bulk operations: 100 requests per hour per user

